Subject: [PATCH] fix(pptx-parser): adjust relative path to ooxml-common test support

In the vendored workspace layout, `crates/pptx-parser` and `crates/ooxml-common`
are peer directories under `crates/`, whereas upstream used `crates/pptx/pptx-parser`.
Adjust the test support include path from `../../../` to `../../`.

---
 crates/pptx-parser/src/lib.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/pptx-parser/src/lib.rs b/crates/pptx-parser/src/lib.rs
index efa4198..c6a4957 100644
--- a/crates/pptx-parser/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/pptx-parser/src/lib.rs
@@ -13642,7 +13642,7 @@ mod tests {
     }
 
     mod lexical_depth_cases {
-        include!("../../../ooxml-common/tests/support/lexical_depth_cases.rs");
+        include!("../../ooxml-common/tests/support/lexical_depth_cases.rs");
     }
 
     #[test]
